WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:02.560
Queen's Blade.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.820
Everything is in accordance with the Queen's will.

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:09.390
The warriors are still unaware of the time, place, or opponent of their next battle.

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:15.190
Fate is said to be ironic; it bewilders the hearts and minds of the warriors.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.270
This match shall be held in the presence of the Queen.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.160
Feel honored.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:26.910
In the presence of the Queen?

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.870
Queen Aldra...

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:33.780
This is the most secluded room of the innermost grounds of Gainos castle.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.720
The Room of Lamentation.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.430
Room of Lamentation...

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.310
So this is your doing?

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:49.670
I had heard that the fights would lead to various locations...

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:50.820
But why here?

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.880
You'll understand shortly.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.680
Now, begin.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.930
Use all the strength you possess to defeat your opponent.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.050
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:14.680
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:28.110
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:35.030
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.370
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:49.090
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:53.510
In order to become

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:58.680
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.760
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:10.020
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:16.070
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:23.080
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.210
Well then, here I come.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.960
Oh, so suddenly?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.420
Impatient, aren't we?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.680
The opponent I must defeat is right there, and yet...

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.110
Do you really think this is an honest battle...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.490
when you're carrying such a burden in your arms?

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:58.620
Do your best, Mommy! Don't lose, okay?

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:01.840
Rana, you mustn't let go. Hold on tight!

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:02.400
Yes!

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:07.200
Playing around with me will get you seriously injured!

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:16.380
I let my guard down.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.780
Using your own child as a shield...

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.890
That surpasses even a departed soul's inhuman manners.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.430
Despite your appearances, you're a treacherous enemy.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:42.780
Wait, isn't that more like cowardice?

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.000
Your excessive concern is unnecessary.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:49.080
This child and I live{breath perhaps} together, and our fate will be to die together.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.280
Should I be killed, this child is coming with me. Prepare yourself for this, and attack!

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:59.200
Well done, Cattleya.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.750
You've said something admirable.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:13.980
W-What strength.{amazing, terrible, dreadful strength/might/force}

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:19.660
Behold, the might{strength} of iron. My weapon is the best in the world!

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:26.160
Look! This solid build can easily withstand a sword blow!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.560
And{and then, and now, thus}...

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.840
And this majestic, destructive, crushing power!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.170
That was close...

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:49.840
Take a look at this high quality battle axe!

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:54.800
If you buy now, you can get a design of your choice carved onto it for free!

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.890
What have you been doing all this time?

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.920
Shut up! Be quiet while I advertise my axe.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.440
Advertise?

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.890
My objective is to make the magnificence of Steel Mountain's weapons...

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:08.860
known throughout the continent!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.910
If I can easily defeat you, who holds the weapon of my business rival...

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:17.460
warriors from all over the world will demand{wish for/request} my weapons, don't you agree?

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.790
In that case, I can't afford to lose, either.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:25.160
I'm very indebted to Cattleya-san.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.110
Don't be so impertinent!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.400
I can't take her head on.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.640
She holds the advantage in both strength and range.

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:36.940
But being at such a disadvantage is only getting me fired up!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.900
That's strange...

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.610
Great archangel, is something the matter?

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:49.600
The match between Airi and Cattleya isn't connected at all, is it?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.350
Oh, is that so?

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.740
Do the relay properly...

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.620
Allowing the Queen to do an angel's job in the first place...

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.200
That's abuse of authority! It's an injustice!

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.590
At any rate, Leina is pretty amazing, isn't she?

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:13.430
Hmph! It looks like the hot air from the cliff's walls is giving you some trouble.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:17.060
Why... are you... okay?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:23.100
Idiot! I was raised alongside the scorching blast furnaces of the dwarf race!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.560
You underestimate me!

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:29.450
It's my long-awaited Queen's Blade match, and yet...

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:34.790
Well, then... it's about time to finish both you and Cattleya's weapon with one strike!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.660
Double Swing!

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.780
How could I be defeated here!?

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.020
Don't, Onee-chan!

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.210
No! It's not over yet.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:51.800
I-It didn't break!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.260
What strength...

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.280
Despite taking that blow directly, she maintained her position.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.730
How wonderful! Onee-chan, look this way!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.050
Damn you! This time, for sure!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.690
Double Swing!

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.910
Dragon Tail!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.100
Well, well. I can't seem to move my body.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.690
It's my loss.

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:35.050
I-I won.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:38.950
We didn't lose to you.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:44.530
I've lost to a great alchemist.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.730
A great alchemist!{maybe question mark}

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:51.780
Cattleya-san.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.870
That little one is starting to get on my nerves.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.420
Vulgar spirits, bring this to an end!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.680
Mommy!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:17.810
Rana!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.140
Now!{It's now.. now's my chance?}

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.660
Heavy!{so heavy}

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.990
Admit defeat.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.000
This is ridiculous...

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.590
I've lost to this mother and her child?

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:58.770
T-This... can't be...

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:01.960
This... this... must be a lie...

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:10.410
This...

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:13.940
Mommy!

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.320
What's wrong all of a sudden?

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.310
Why... why are you in such a shape?

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.750
Mommy!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.840
Please don't think badly of me.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:43.720
Please step back. Otherwise, I'll cut off your head as well!

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:56.950
Say, if you don't have the will to fight, are you fine with admitting your defeat?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.320
It doesn't matter.{no problem.. don't mind.. whatever}

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.950
Are you listening, Your Highness?

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:04.500
Yes.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:07.150
Temptress of the Underworld, Airi.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.710
Victory is yours.

00:10:09.990 --> 00:10:12.520
The outcome of this battle doesn't matter.

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.090
After all, our intention was...

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.720
to search for this person.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.360
Your Highness...

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:26.100
Why is my husband in a shape like this?

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.980
What did you say? Your husband?

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.770
This?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.100
He's my father.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:34.610
{it's }Owen.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.150
Owen!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.090
I've heard of him.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.290
He's been called a dragon slayer, among other things...

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:46.620
<i>Now</i> do you understand my reason for selecting this stage?

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:50.700
Those faces, mixed with astonishment and despair...

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:54.340
To me, that is the greatest wine.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.190
I'll give you a reward for amusing me.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:03.300
I permit you to stand in harmony with your beloved husband...{your beloved husband (getting along well with.. in harmony etc..) to affix/append/attach along do permit/approve/authorize}

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.640
for eternity!

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:20.410
That's the first time I've seen a human with the Evil Eye.

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:27.460
If I recall correctly, that's... the living weapon, Funikura.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.000
Why is it in a place like this?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:34.900
Mommy! Mommy! Hey, say something!

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:36.950
Rana!

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:40.030
Rana.

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:53.040
Mommy!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.700
What bad taste.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:13.040
Well then, I'll quickly take my leave from this ominous place.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.910
The Temptress of the Underworld finds this ominous?

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:20.160
It's a question of taste.{hobby, preference}

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.220
I couldn't possibly allow you to leave...

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.010
you servant of the Swamp Witch.

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:29.890
Examine the stone pillar beside you.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.110
Melona?

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:52.990
Impudent one!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.470
Vulgar{low grade} spirits!

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:00.750
Now!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.470
What in the world are you...?{Just what are you...?}

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.180
We should run!

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.040
I'll just crush these ghosts...

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:13.230
Geez...

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.730
I guess it can't be helped.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.900
Fools! Do you think you can escape!?

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:22.110
I'll return my gratitude for today eventually.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.860
Hey, lady...

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.340
What is it?

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.910
Your clothes... your clothes are disappearing.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:32.830
I'm aware of that!

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.150
I'm exhausted.{worn-out.}

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.980
Yay! I won!

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:54.020
I wonder if Tomoe was watching?

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.290
It would have been great to celebrate with her.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:04.570
And I need to tell Risty, too.

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:16.650
Onee-chan, are you alright?

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:21.590
I don't possess the strength to carry this burden around.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:25.630
I finally understand how terrifying that woman was.

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:29.800
Excuse me.{same as in line 108 if you wonder about the asobase... it's a polite speech used by woman to replace nasai with asobase}

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.390
I'll be taking your life force.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.520
I feel like I've been revived.{restored to life, came to myself}

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.560
Though I can't really say that, being a departed soul myself...

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:47.240
Come, we're going.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.370
Who are you?{who is it?}

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.990
You are...

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.190
the Chivalrous Wasteland Thief, Risty.

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.960
Why are you here?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.750
Your soul is...

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:13.180
Don't!{No!}

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.170
Risty-dono!

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.340
Now!

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:32.240
Congratulations, Leina-san.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.530
I'm back!{home.. well this isn't their home}

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.450
W-Welcome back!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.290
I saw it at the marketplace. Leina won, right?

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.460
It seems that way.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:44.290
It seems that another fight was also taking place.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.040
That one wasn't relayed.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.710
It wasn't relayed?

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.040
They only made progress announcements.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:54.580
Airi or whoever, that subordinate of the Swamp Witch, was the victor.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:58.220
The loser was... you know, that mother, the weapons merchant.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.520
Cattleya-san...{maybe append lost}

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:01.450
Is that so?

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:06.400
I'm sure that lively boy must be a little sad about that.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:16.240
Well, since we've come this far, you can escape on your own, right?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.470
Well then, excuse me.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:28.470
I never thought Melona would be in such a shape.{appearance}

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:30.850
As well as{Besides/Moreover} that living weapon...

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:35.060
If I'm not mistaken, he's of the same family as us ancient demonic beings.

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:42.860
What if Aldra wants to encase all the demonic participants of Queen's Blade in stone?

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.730
If so, why would she petrify Cattleya and her husband as well?

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.240
Furthermore, that thief woman is Aldra's subordinate?

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:57.240
Geez... Just thinking about it is making my head explode.

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:02.630
What is it? You're really distracting...

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.040
Little one! What do you think you're doing?

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:12.630
E-Even if you look at me with those eyes, I have nothing to do with you.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.340
Go away already.{quickly go ....}

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:15.870
Where to?

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.790
How should I know?

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:22.880
But it's thanks to this little one that I escaped.

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.600
I can't just heartlessly abandon him here...

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:31.450
No, no. For the Temptress of the Underwood, Airi, to show compassion to a human child...

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.890
I won, Risty.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.370
Come in.{enter}

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:52.300
Leina! Are you there?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.700
Ymir?

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.680
S-Say, are your injuries already...

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:03.770
As you can see! Don't take the dwarves' resilience lightly!

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.440
Did you need something from me?

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:10.200
Yes. I want you to entrust me with your sword.{actually she says she want's reina to give custody or keeping of the sword to her}

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:10.730
Heh?

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:14.110
There's no way I could do something like that!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.610
Cattleya just admitted defeat.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.100
Eh, Cattleya-san too?

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:20.330
What's with the "too"?

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:21.690
Ah, sorry...

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:26.390
Why don't you know about the fact that Cattleya lost?

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.190
I've been sleeping this whole time.

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:31.350
Cattleya disappeared just like that.

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:33.500
She probably returned to Bosk.{I seem to catch a daga in her usual jaga style here which would imply an added: but...}

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.770
I see. I wish I could have given her my thanks...

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:43.180
This sword, created using holy steel made by a great alchemist...

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:48.990
Since our fight, I have been captivated by a certain idea.

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:50.000
Idea?

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.510
Yes. Applying Dwarven techniques to this sword,

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:56.440
further enhancing it, thereby making it the strongest weapon. That idea.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:01.620
Are you saying that you're going to reforge an alchemist's sword?

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:04.710
This is not about Steel Mountain or alchemists!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.490
This is my nature as an arms maker!

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:14.900
I swear on my name as the princess of the dwarf families that no harm will befall this sword.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.130
Ymir...

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:20.050
Leina, entrust this sword to me!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.040
Okay.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:26.080
That's my Leina.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.660
That big turnaround at the last moment...

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.910
I'm looking forward to it more and more.

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:36.170
I'm sure your turn is coming up next, Claudette.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:37.980
Yes.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.450
It looks that way.{It seems like it. It seems so. It seems that way}

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.870
Ah! R-Right there.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.020
That's it!{kiku: to be effective, to carry out its function well etc etc...}

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.830
Ah, yes... a little harder...

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:52.100
They multiplied{increased} considerably, eh?

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.370
There's still more to come.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.250
For the revival of the Amara Kingdom-

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.880
Ah that's great!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:02.520
Even if I turn all the residents of this capital into servants, it still won't-

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.100
Ah, so good!

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:07.660
This isn't the time to say such easygoing things.

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:08.550
It feels good there, too!

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:09.850
Your turn is surely coming up next, Menace.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:13.380
I'll worry about that when the time comes.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:16.540
It won't be my fault if you end up petrified like Melona!

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:20.500
By the way, Airi-san, when was the delivery?

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:21.790
D-Delivery?

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:26.150
I didn't know you had such a big child!

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.410
How rude!

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:30.910
